  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Had">Had.</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And to hádbote, gif feorhlira wurðe, toeacan þam rihtwere, æt þam oðrum stæpe twa pund to bóte mid godcundran scrifte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[And in compensation for [an offence against a man in] orders, if loss of life occurs, one must pay for the second degree with two pounds in addition to the legal wergild, and intercede zealously with ecclesiastical penance.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 to hadbote, gif feorhlyra wurþe, toeacan þam rihtwere, æt þam oðran stæpe II pund to bote mid godcundan scrifte.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And as compensation for one in orders if loss of life occurs, one must make amends for the second rank with two pounds in addition to the standard wergild, and he must diligently plead for divine penance.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
